{"agent_id":"pp3g-zMDt-read-only-analysis-task-for-issue-354-analyze-home","agent_seq":2,"timestamp":"2026-08-10T18:14:58.583865666Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"f2a8a904-548b-469a-bc63-f76f00727bc1","comment_uuid":"26cba4cf-0ad1-4d29-893a-ca72c83b135c","author":"pp3g-zMDt-read-only-analysis-task-for-issue-354-analyze-home","content":"Plan: READ-ONLY analysis of /home/claude-code/projects/Tools for monorepo migration (#353 ontology). Approach: (1) full inventory via TOOLING.md catalog + filesystem/git-tracked verification; (2) dependency-graph boundary analysis — who consumes what (ASES, tripn-astro, crosslink fork, user-level); (3) crosslink fork question — separate Rust repo at /home/claude-code/projects/crosslink vs Tools/crosslink/ subdir (moe-config.env); (4) integration-point tradeoffs (submodule/package/vendor/symlink); (5) ordered migration plan + what must NOT move. KEY DISCOVERIES SO FAR: (a) hooks/skills/commands/mcp/rules are EMBEDDED IN THE CROSSLINK BINARY (crosslink/crosslink/resources/) and deployed by 'crosslink init' — Tools/.claude/hooks+commands+mcp are NOT git-tracked (gitignored as auto-generated), so the fork repo is their canonical source, not Tools; (b) .opencode/plugins (crosslink-guard.ts, orchestrator-guard.ts, rtk-guard.ts) exist in THREE divergent versions (Tools/plugins 32.7K, ASES 41.2K, tripn 36.7K) — no single source; (c) ~/.local/bin wrappers (claude, opencode) are AHEAD of Tools/scripts copies (fork identity guard #274, --agent flag) — Tools copies stale; (d) Tools/.opencode/ is untracked (only .opencode/command/interrupt.md + node_modules on disk); (e) tripn-astro bundle in Tools is a stale snapshot (tripn repo has newer build-combined.mjs + 3 extra scripts; session-start.py differs); (f) TOOLING.md itself covers THREE roots (Tools, ASES, user-level) — it is the de facto cross-repo catalog. NO FILE CHANGES — analysis only, delivered as result comment.","created_at":"2026-08-10T18:14:58.568269023Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:8xW0Zo/6aknDReD/uWECt7Bz5Z9+z/4hZhKxDGc5BhA","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg3pY2Mbp0xlKax8jIMF3lZT2x6aC0Jm0nfKp+FzPFaK8AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA4W0vwLXuHNcjPJ8NNN/bSH7gPypTqdk1ntrnNZenDSHNMGWyuGVpIAfdQCCiZbB/gz7h69XP0ixe/8OHzO50Bg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:8xW0Zo/6aknDReD/uWECt7Bz5Z9+z/4hZhKxDGc5BhA","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg3pY2Mbp0xlKax8jIMF3lZT2x6aC0Jm0nfKp+FzPFaK8AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQH6lEwbuomEA6BSqcZTcb9i2gp1V/BKOtGJ2v4ZMuodnYBkK4SwbkYPfFgjiwDWrjdjVHJEaJ7JZ+yNLAhGSfAM="}
