{"agent_id":"pp3g-zMDt-read-only-analysis-task-for-issue-354-analyze-home","agent_seq":7,"timestamp":"2026-08-10T18:21:13.523907493Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"f2a8a904-548b-469a-bc63-f76f00727bc1","comment_uuid":"dd788851-b277-42c9-9261-a6a3b06e740b","author":"pp3g-zMDt-read-only-analysis-task-for-issue-354-analyze-home","content":"Completed: READ-ONLY analysis of Tools repo for monorepo migration delivered on #354 as --kind result. Key findings: (1) hooks/skills/commands/mcp/rules are embedded in the crosslink binary and deployed by 'crosslink init' — fork repo is their canonical source, not Tools; (2) .opencode/guard plugins diverged 3 ways (Tools 32.7K / ASES 41.2K / tripn 36.7K); (3) ~/.local/bin wrappers ahead of Tools/scripts (fork identity guard #274, --agent); (4) tripn-astro bundle in Tools is a stale snapshot; (5) recommended integration = Tools stays sibling warehouse + sync-tooling.sh deploy script; fork stays sibling repo under ~/projects/crosslink. 6 sections delivered: inventory, boundary analysis, fork question, integration points, migration plan, what-not-tested. No files changed, no commits.","created_at":"2026-08-10T18:21:13.516430597Z","kind":"handoff","signed_by":"SHA256:8xW0Zo/6aknDReD/uWECt7Bz5Z9+z/4hZhKxDGc5BhA","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg3pY2Mbp0xlKax8jIMF3lZT2x6aC0Jm0nfKp+FzPFaK8AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABASNypNTHPtgS3tFPWY9y6RfSCoiwmBOvHZxpBqGl7IsW6bMphjIyEnPkwkvHVyn3F4ArBOCBXVjMapV3cEb3kAg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:8xW0Zo/6aknDReD/uWECt7Bz5Z9+z/4hZhKxDGc5BhA","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg3pY2Mbp0xlKax8jIMF3lZT2x6aC0Jm0nfKp+FzPFaK8AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPGljIIcBrTQEVshtEwt85Y9wI62Epd7ZGp0YSYW5+yVfwCQRKmwQNWDuH3EIiqgYN4gIDTfetYtAjyjOjR87wM="}
